readme.text:
坐标都是物理像素。

```js
// 找控件
desktop { action: "find", text: "保存", window: "记事本" }

// 点击前校验文字，点击后校验结果

All coordinates are physical pixels.

```js
desktop { action: "find", text: "Save", window: "Notepad" }

desktop { action: "click", x: 812, y: 460, window: "Notepad", expect: "Save", verifyText: "Saved" }
